{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"P0A847","secondaryAccessions":["P19675","P19676","P78226","Q2MC20","Q47627"],"uniProtkbId":"TGT_ECOLI","entryAudit":{"firstPublicDate":"2005-06-07","lastAnnotationUpdateDate":"2026-01-28","lastSequenceUpdateDate":"2005-06-07","entryVersion":142,"sequenceVersion":1},"annotationScore":5.0,"organism":{"scientificName":"Escherichia coli (strain K12)","taxonId":83333,"lineage":["Bacteria","Pseudomonadati","Pseudomonadota","Gammaproteobacteria","Enterobacterales","Enterobacteriaceae","Escherichia"]},"proteinExistence":"1: Evidence at protein level","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"}],"value":"Queuine tRNA-ribosyltransferase"},"ecNumbers":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11714265"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"12909636"}],"value":"2.4.2.29"}]},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"}],"value":"Guanine insertion enzyme"}},{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"}],"value":"tRNA-guanine transglycosylase"}}]},"genes":[{"geneName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"}],"value":"tgt"},"orderedLocusNames":[{"value":"b0406"},{"value":"JW0396"}]}],"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000255","source":"HAMAP-Rule","id":"MF_00168"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11714265"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"12909636"}],"value":"Catalyzes the base-exchange of a guanine (G) residue with the queuine precursor 7-aminomethyl-7-deazaguanine (PreQ1) at position 34 (anticodon wobble position) in tRNAs with GU(N) anticodons (tRNA-Asp, -Asn, -His and -Tyr). Catalysis occ